(7690465, 1260085, 173844, '<td valign="top">Here it is.  The most penetrating, heart-in-the-throat image entered, in my humble opinion.  Starkly real.  Both about to plunge their wings downward, to close the gap or not. Beautifully captured and centered.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Here it is.  The most penetrating, heart-in-the-throat image entered, in my humble opinion.  Starkly real.  Both about to plunge their wings downward, to close the gap or not. Beautifully captured and centered.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2021-03-28 23:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7690467, 1260127, 173844, '<td valign="top">This low key image really captures the mental anguish of someone who finds himself in a deep hole.  It must feel that the only way out is to go deeper.  It''s set up and captured beautifully.  The upflung cards, nicely catching the light, are marvelous, putting emotion in motion.  The man''s expression is telling, and driving the entire scene.<br/>Personal second favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'This low key image really captures the mental anguish of someone who finds himself in a deep hole.  It must feel that the only way out is to go deeper.  It''s set up and captured beautifully.  The upflung cards, nicely catching the light, are marvelous, putting emotion in motion.  The man''s expression is telling, and driving the entire scene.Personal second favorite of the challenge.', '2021-03-28 23:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7690469, 1260130, 173844, '<td valign="top">The juxtaposition of the lovely crocuses and the sudden drop-off into a gulley is startling and moving.  It''s tough enough for these flowers, but it sure does also resonate with us humans.  Many, if not most of us, understand what it is to be in a perilous situation, as shown here.  Fine image.</td>', 'The juxtaposition of the lovely crocuses and the sudden drop-off into a gulley is startling and moving.  It''s tough enough for these flowers, but it sure does also resonate with us humans.  Many, if not most of us, understand what it is to be in a perilous situation, as shown here.  Fine image.', '2021-03-28 23:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7690470, 1260119, 173844, '<td valign="top">Clever, funny and gracefully executed.  This little fellow is my new hero.</td>', 'Clever, funny and gracefully executed.  This little fellow is my new hero.', '2021-03-28 23:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7690471, 1260103, 173844, '<td valign="top">Yeah, every workday putting your body and life at risk.  So, as this excellent black and white image documents, it''s this moment, and repeated ones every day, that keep our society running.  His concentration and finesse are adroitly captured.  The confusion of branches adds to the innate tension of the image.  Nice.</td>', 'Yeah, every workday putting your body and life at risk.  So, as this excellent black and white image documents, it''s this moment, and repeated ones every day, that keep our society running.  His concentration and finesse are adroitly captured.  The confusion of branches adds to the innate tension of the image.  Nice.', '2021-03-28 23:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7690473, 1260134, 173844, '<td valign="top">Sometimes, as here, the title is everything.  Maybe not this ice, but we all know, with anguish, that the earth is taking a disastrous turn.  Maybe there''s still time to<br/>forestall and limit the damage, but that''s a big maybe.  Your stark image speaks to the sad peril.  I like how the ice shimmers and kind of blows out, setting up the heavy message.</td>', 'Sometimes, as here, the title is everything.  Maybe not this ice, but we all know, with anguish, that the earth is taking a disastrous turn.  Maybe there''s still time toforestall and limit the damage, but that''s a big maybe.  Your stark image speaks to the sad peril.  I like how the ice shimmers and kind of blows out, setting up the heavy message.', '2021-03-28 23:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
